      "comment" : "Game exit summary, explanation, or session exit log. %1$@: localized game exit summary; %2$@: game process ID; %3$@: localized termination-kind label (Signal or Exit code); %4$@: termination signal number or exit code; %5$@: localized yes/no for Ruri stop request; %6$@: localized yes/no for normal quit request; %7$@: ISO 8601 start time; %8$@: ISO 8601 end time.",
